# In-app notifications

Built in Phase 10; channels (web push, Telegram) added in Phase 17. Preferences are separate from the notification center.

## Rules

- Always create through the `notifications` service helpers. Never raw SQL at call sites.
- Non-fatal: notification failure must not fail the underlying write or workflow step.
- Dedupe with a unique `(workspace_id, user_id, type, dedupe_key)`; digests coalesce, instant alerts do not.
- Per-user read state; no shared `read_at` on the notification row.
- Realtime via SSE/WebSocket from the API; the client degrades to polling.
- Content: titles and bodies use job title + company only. No resume text, answers, emails, or sensitive field values (`pii-guard.mdc`).
- Do not emit from the agent/AI layer if the underlying service already emits.
